graph LR
    OpenShell["OpenShell<br/>(Gateway + Supervisor + Sandbox)"]

    %% Kubernetes Dependencies
    OpenShell -->|"pod CRUD, TokenReview"| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API<br/>1.29+"]
    OpenShell -->|"sandbox lifecycle"| SandboxCRD["agents.x-k8s.io<br/>Sandbox CRD"]
